3. 修改内容概要 / Summary of modifications
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

  * 用 ArkTS 重写 Android/Kotlin 实现，目标平台由 Android 改为
    OpenHarmony / HarmonyOS（Stage 模型，API 21+）。
  * 用自实现的 SCSI Bulk-Only Transport 栈（@ohos.usbManager）替换
    libaums 的 USB Mass Storage 实现。
  * 用 ArkUI 声明式 UI 重写 Compose 界面（首页 / 确认页 / 进度页）。
  * 协程与 Channel 改为 ArkTS 异步队列；WakeLock 改为后台长时任务
    （DATA_TRANSFER）；SharedPreferences 改为 @ohos.data.preferences。
  * 移除原版的可选遥测 / Sentry 上报与商店评价相关代码。
  * 应用文案已本地化为中文（zh_CN 资源，译法对齐上游官方 values-zh-rCN）。
  * 逐文件对应关系见源码中各文件头部的注释（"Port of ..."）。

  * Rewritten in ArkTS for OpenHarmony / HarmonyOS (Stage model, API 21+).
  * The libaums USB Mass Storage implementation was replaced by a hand-written
    SCSI Bulk-Only Transport stack on top of @ohos.usbManager.
  * Compose UI replaced by ArkUI (start / confirm / progress pages).
  * Coroutines and Channels replaced by an ArkTS async queue; WakeLock replaced
    by a DATA_TRANSFER continuous task; SharedPreferences replaced by
    @ohos.data.preferences.
  * The upstream optional telemetry / Sentry reporting and store-review code
    were removed.
  * The UI strings ship with a Simplified Chinese localization (zh_CN
    resources), using the same wording as upstream's values-zh-rCN.
  * Per-file correspondence is documented in the header comment of each source
    file ("Port of ...").

